                    <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500"></i>
                    AI-Powered Adaptive Education
                </div>
                
                <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 text-slate-900 leading-tight drop-shadow-sm">
                    Smart Learning <br>
