                </h1>
                
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
                    Experience personalized education that adapts to your unique learning style. Our multi-agent AI system analyzes your progress and optimizes your path to mastery.
                </p>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-12">
