                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Personalized Learning Paths</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">AI creates unique study roadmaps tailored to your goals, pace, and knowledge gaps.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                    <div class="bg-emerald-100 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="brain-circuit" class="text-emerald-600 w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Adaptive Quizzes</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">MCQ, True/False, short answer, and essay questions that adjust difficulty in real-time.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                    <div class="bg-teal-100 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="message-square-text" class="text-teal-600 w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">AI-Generated Feedback</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Instant, detailed explanations and personalized guidance on every answer you give.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 0ms;">
                    <div class="bg-orange-100 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="video" class="text-orange-600 w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Video & Resource Recommendations</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Curated educational content matched to your current topic and learning style.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                    <div class="bg-orange-50 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="bar-chart-2" class="text-orange-600 w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Progress Analytics</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Visual dashboards showing your growth, strengths, and areas needing improvement.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 6 -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 feature-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                    <div class="bg-indigo-100 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm">
                        <i data-lucide="git-commit" class="text-indigo-600 w-6 h-6"></i>
