                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Bayesian models estimate your mastery of each concept based on observed behaviors and performance.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm reveal feature-card">
                        <i data-lucide="network" class="text-primary w-6 h-6 mb-4"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Reinforcement Engine</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The system learns from every interaction, continuously improving recommendations and difficulty calibration.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm reveal feature-card" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                        <i data-lucide="zap" class="text-primary w-6 h-6 mb-4"></i>
